WEBVTT

00:01:30.890 --> 00:01:32.779
I always felt good with Dick Feynman.

00:01:33.136 --> 00:01:35.110
It was always fun to be with him.

00:01:35.586 --> 00:01:37.348
He always made me feel smart.

00:01:37.753 --> 00:01:39.960
How can somebody like that
make you feel smart?

00:01:39.984 --> 00:01:41.150
Somehow he did.

00:01:41.174 --> 00:01:43.634
He made me feel smart.
He made me feel he was smart.

00:01:43.658 --> 00:01:45.609
He made me feel we were both smart,

00:01:45.633 --> 00:01:48.975
and the two of us could solve
any problem whatever.

00:01:50.083 --> 00:01:53.091
And in fact, we did sometimes
do physics together.

00:01:53.115 --> 00:01:55.160
We never published a paper together,

00:01:55.184 --> 00:01:56.644
but we did have a lot of fun.

00:01:58.760 --> 00:01:59.976
He loved to win,